{"steam_appid":3932790,"steam_name":"Garfield - Escape from Monday","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932790/1190917305/b9df683c84cd79656269ab7f21c4eaf86bb990f9/1789993380/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790262083","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257430608/bfeecdff99b0d0863db9cdabba32341f7cdd8c19/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790262083","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/97169eb35a2dc880748b3f1a9433c8dd565e2ee5/ss_97169eb35a2dc880748b3f1a9433c8dd565e2ee5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790262085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/2d9d000bb13846cb4b91e6f3bac78d840c060adb/ss_2d9d000bb13846cb4b91e6f3bac78d840c060adb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790262085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/57ede91e1064efcca5fab77701dc260e864a8cb4/ss_57ede91e1064efcca5fab77701dc260e864a8cb4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790262085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/36f112c0edc8c6eb1f366f5486eb1e759813a419/ss_36f112c0edc8c6eb1f366f5486eb1e759813a419.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790262085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/d1de02eee19a71968f1767d47bfb9a39fbc9bc02/ss_d1de02eee19a71968f1767d47bfb9a39fbc9bc02.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790262085"],"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wake up Garfield from this nightmarish veggie filled 3D Platformer! The laziest cat is about to work hard in Garfield - Escape from Monday!</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/cd122b8ee257d82551479b84c5d54a3f.poster.avif?t=1790262085\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/cd122b8ee257d82551479b84c5d54a3f.webm?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/cd122b8ee257d82551479b84c5d54a3f.mp4?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Garfield may be right not to trust vegetables…<br>When you’re a lazy cat spending most of his time sleeping, having a nightmare can happen. But a nightmare full of vegetables and sugar-free candies, no way! <br>After Jon fed him spinach lasagnas inspired by Chef Monday’s recipe, Garfield falls into a deep sleep...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/e66f5f7ae8b4f4ad50761a0ffefe1a68.poster.avif?t=1790262085\" width=780 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/e66f5f7ae8b4f4ad50761a0ffefe1a68.webm?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/e66f5f7ae8b4f4ad50761a0ffefe1a68.mp4?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To wake up and reactivate his taste buds, the laziest cat in the world will have to explore worlds filled with enemies and eat a gigantic deal of lasagnas!<br>Fortunately Garfield can rely on Jon and his friends Odie, Arlene and Pookie. But also on his turkey, surfer and cowboy suits that will give him amazing skills!<br><br><strong>Move like a cat</strong><br>Jump, climb the walls, curl up into a ball… you will always land on your feet!<br><br><strong>Embody Garfield in every form</strong><br>Go airborne dressed as a turkey, slide on the water like a surfer and swing with your cowboy lasso!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/8cc0e5b20d842cdda88dc5e151874a91.poster.avif?t=1790262085\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/8cc0e5b20d842cdda88dc5e151874a91.webm?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/8cc0e5b20d842cdda88dc5e151874a91.mp4?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>All the Garfield cast is here</strong><br>Jon will be here to help you in your quest, along with Odie and Pookie. But beware Garfield's archenemies, Nermal and Squeak!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/2d91a02b02a5cd70809f62484aee5305.poster.avif?t=1790262085\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/2d91a02b02a5cd70809f62484aee5305.webm?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/2d91a02b02a5cd70809f62484aee5305.mp4?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore lively worlds</strong><br>3 worlds and dozens of levels filled with enemies to fight and lasagnas to devour to regain the taste!<br><br><strong>The more you eat, the more rooms you edit!</strong><br>Gather tons of delicious collectibles to keep your morale and help refurbish Jon's house with all kinds of surprising items!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/3cc6bf10bb07e39f26e56f9635c2fd3a.poster.avif?t=1790262085\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/3cc6bf10bb07e39f26e56f9635c2fd3a.webm?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932790/extras/3cc6bf10bb07e39f26e56f9635c2fd3a.mp4?t=1790262085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 - 7700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 - 8700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["OSome Studio"],"publishers":["Microids"],"release_date":"24 Sep, 2026"}